          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #3E4F73">Votre fiche Google, votre site et votre référencement, pour qu'on vous trouve en premier.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 6px">
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #EEF2F9; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 13px">Site internet</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #EEF2F9; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 13px">Géo / SEO</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #EEF2F9; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 13px">Publicité</span>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #EEF2F9; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 13px">Google Business Profile</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="vp-card" style="position: relative; flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; padding: 12px 12px 28px; border-radius: 28px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #DCE3F0; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(6,37,90,0.06); color: #06255A">
