                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff"><span style="animation: vpPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3DDC84"></span>Appel en cours</div>
              </div>
              <div style="height: 156px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent, #000 26%); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent, #000 26%)">
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM1 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-end">
                  <div style="max-width: 88%; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #F58220; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 8px 11px">Plomberie Martin, bonjour ! Je suis son assistante, je vous écoute.</div>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM2 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-start">
                  <div style="max-width: 88%; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 14px 14px 14px 4px; padding: 8px 11px">Bonjour, j'ai une fuite sous mon évier, ça coule depuis ce matin.</div>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM3 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-end">
                  <div style="max-width: 88%; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #F58220; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 8px 11px">Je note ça tout de suite. Vous avez pu couper l'eau ?</div>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM4 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-start">
