                </div>
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM5 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-end">
                  <div style="max-width: 88%; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #F58220; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 8px 11px">Parfait. Quelle est votre adresse ?</div>
                </div>
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM6 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-start">
                  <div style="max-width: 88%; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border-radius: 14px 14px 14px 4px; padding: 8px 11px">Rue des Lilas, à Carcassonne.</div>
                </div>
