                </div>
                <div style="flex: none; overflow: hidden; display: flex; animation: vpM9 32s infinite; justify-content: flex-end">
                  <div style="max-width: 88%; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; color: #06255A; background: #F58220; border-radius: 14px 14px 4px 14px; padding: 8px 11px">C'est noté. Le plombier vous rappelle dans la matinée.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div style="animation: vpMs 32s infinite; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px 12px">
